      "start_seconds": 8.65,
      "end_seconds": 13.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "So, come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.48,
      "end_seconds": 19.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I wanted to get a bitten tongue looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.41,
      "end_seconds": 23.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.13,
      "end_seconds": 35.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "so, bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.95,
      "end_seconds": 54.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.55,
      "text": "okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, respiratory rate 16, blood pressure 126 over 79. And temperature 36.4, heart rate 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.67,
      "end_seconds": 71.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "okay, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.33,
      "end_seconds": 79.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "About four days, I think... sorry, ten days, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.39,
      "end_seconds": 97.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "has there been any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.03,
      "end_seconds": 100.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "no chest pain, thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.59,
      "end_seconds": 104.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Have you had any fever or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.01,
      "end_seconds": 111.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "I mean you know no none that that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.81,
      "end_seconds": 114.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.88,
      "end_seconds": 117.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.35,
      "end_seconds": 136.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "okay any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.86,
      "end_seconds": 139.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "no not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.31,
      "end_seconds": 143.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Alright a few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.74,
      "end_seconds": 163.88,
      "duration_seconds": 18.14,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I work in accounts at a hospital. I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.36,
      "end_seconds": 176.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.31,
      "end_seconds": 178.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "no known allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.71,
      "end_seconds": 183.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "okay, is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.54,
      "end_seconds": 187.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "no, I'm not on anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.62,
      "end_seconds": 193.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.82,
      "end_seconds": 195.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "not really no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.7,
      "end_seconds": 199.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Let's move on to the the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.76,
      "end_seconds": 201.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "of course"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.08,
      "end_seconds": 206.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.58,
      "end_seconds": 226.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "The neurological examination is normal with steady walking and equal power."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.19,
      "end_seconds": 266.83,
      "duration_seconds": 35.64,
      "text": "all finished, thank you. Let me tell you where I've got to. I think we're dealing with a possible first seizure at this stage. I'll request an EEG, it'll help with possible seizure. I'll request an ECG, it'll help with loss of consciousness. No driving until you have been seen in the clinic, and avoid swimming or climbing alone. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.12,
      "end_seconds": 292.41,
      "duration_seconds": 24.29,
      "text": "we'll refer you to the epilepsy clinic the thing that would worry me is if you have another episode or one lasts more than five minutes if that happens, go to emergency i'd like to see you again after the scan let me check I've been clear what will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.28,
      "end_seconds": 299.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "so, I come back after the scan is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.28,
      "end_seconds": 306.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Yes exactly right. Right that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.19,
      "end_seconds": 309.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    }
  ]
